Goal: Create a game similar to crossy road
objective: player must manage through traffic and avoid being hit by cars
once player clears traffic and makes it to the top of screen, they reset to the bottom and the difficulty increases
1 point awarded per level

Step 1: Create player class
- must be able to control the player (only moving upwards starting from the bottom of the screen
- must have a method to "level up" or reset the player to the bottom after theyve reached the top of the screen

Step 2: Create a car class
- must be able to increase in difficulty (increase amount of cars present & speed of cars)
- generates a random Y position to bring cars through
- only generates cars increments so theres no overlapping cars
- every car has a different color

Step 3: Detect collision between cars and player
- ends the game

Step 4: Create scoreboard
- Increments in score witch each level

